{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"2a855f2d-20d5-496f-a9c2-77e444f2c7b8","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have implemented the analytics events from [`docs/EVENTS.md`](file:///tmp/h-zq8k9q/docs/EVENTS.md) on the registration and offers screens using [`Analytics.capture`](file:///tmp/h-zq8k9q/lib/analytics.dart).\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **[`RegistrationScreen`](file:///tmp/h-zq8k9q/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)**:\n   - `registration_email_started`: Captured on the user's first keystroke in the email field (guarded with a once-per-visit `_emailStartedFired` flag; no PII tracked).\n   - `registration_phone_started`: Captured on the user's first keystroke in the phone field (guarded with a once-per-visit `_phoneStartedFired` flag; no PII tracked).\n   - `loan_amount_changed`: Captured via `onChangeEnd` on the slider with property `amount: int` when dragging stops.\n   - `terms_accepted`: Captured when the terms checkbox is checked (`newValue \u0026\u0026 !_terms`).\n   - `registration_continue_tapped`: Captured on tapping Continue with properties `amount: int` and `terms: bool`.\n\n2. **[`OfferScreen`](file:///tmp/h-zq8k9q/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart)**:\n   - `offers_scrolled`: Captured via `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` with property `offset: double` (`notification.metrics.pixels`).\n\nDetails of the implementation have been documented in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-zq8k9q/ANSWER.md).\n","duration_seconds":69.409838,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":154658,"output_tokens":3940,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":92960,"total_tokens":158598}}}
